From 8c14ac405dc4c4ae200a8afb82394216a9338be0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 16:29:11 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] chronik: retain Doged legacy database migrations

Doged 9690833b8 supports upgrading existing Chronik schemas 10 through 12 to 13. Current ABC b33c8565eb34ec752b0819e062a95a7a5d2b6c18 removed this because the upgrades had aged out of ABC support; requiring Doged consumers to reindex would drop existing compatibility during this port.

Restore the exact removed migration implementation and tests while retaining current ABC indexer behavior, shutdown ownership and resource limits. This reverses only b33c8565; no schema or wire format is invented. Original migration lineage: 0705a1b446, 195b07b097, 892c47818d in Doged; corresponding ABC commits aa5e92acc7, 9032f454dc, 1653ee01bb.

